libsurface (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 0.2.0: the X-Touch module, and libdiginet 0.1.4 as the floor
  * tests/diginet: a Control|24 comes up ONLINE on the a0, then RENEWED on
    its first e1, with one board replay after it
  * tests/diginet: the emulator copies from libdiginet f3a78df, the 0.1.4
    release
  * The Mackie module: its tests through MIDI bytes, its packages, its CI job
    (#10)
  * The Mackie module's host calls: strip paint, motor-report query, layer
    suspend, clip, reset (#10)
  * tests/diginet: the emulator copies from libdiginet aa650dec, the 0.1.3
    release
  * release.yml: python3 comes from the shared rpm build
  * The Mackie module (libsurface-mackie): MCU surfaces over libmackie (#10)

